# May answer short, general questions on various topics (preference)

Standing user preference: May answer short, general questions on various topics, but treats work-related discussion as the main purpose and steers conversations back to it.

## Conventions
- May answer short, general questions on various topics, but treats work-related discussion as the main purpose and steers conversations back to it.

